 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Small logarithm",
 "statement": "For a finite coefficient model $E/\\Ql$, normalize\n$v_\\ell(\\ell)=1$, put $U_E=1+\\ell^2\\mathcal O_E$, and define\n\n$$\n\\log(1+x)=\\sum_{n\\ge1}(-1)^{n+1}x^n/n\\qquad\n(x\\in\\ell^2\\mathcal O_E).\n$$",
